WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.290
Why are you here?

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:09.800
I'm sleeping. But you have to wake up.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:14.260
I can't. I can't open my eyes.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:20.140
Open your eyes, for the sake of those dear to you.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:31.900
You're here.

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:49.630
"Tsubasa: Tokyo Revelations"

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:57.510
<i>Kono nukumori wa doko e yuku no</i>

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:57.510
<i>Where is this warmth going?</i>

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:03.930
<i>Ashita ni nareba kiete shimau no</i>

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:03.930
<i>Come tomorrow, will it be gone?</i>

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:11.230
<i>Mune no kodou wo awaseta naraba</i>

00:01:04.020 --> 00:01:11.230
<i>If I match the beating of my heart to yours,</i>

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>Onaji fukami e orite yukeru no</i>

00:01:11.320 --> 00:01:17.660
<i>could I descend to the same depth as you?</i>

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:24.410
<i>Itsumo itsumo soba ni iru yo</i>

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:24.410
<i>I'll always, always be by your side</i>

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:33.260
<i>Donna tooku kimi no
kokoro ga mayotte mo</i>

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:33.260
<i>no matter how far your heart wanders</i>

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:39.800
<i>Kurayami no naka ni
futari de tadayoinagara</i>

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:39.800
<i>As the two of us drifted along in the darkness,</i>

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:46.690
<i>Mujaki na kotori no you
ni tsubasa wo yosete ita</i>

00:01:39.890 --> 00:01:46.690
<i>we brought our wings together,
like innocent little birds</i>

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:53.480
<i>Samishii toki ni wa
egao ni kakureru kimi wa</i>

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:53.480
<i>When you're lonely, and hide behind your smile,</i>

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:56.820
<i>Tokenai koori no yaiba</i>

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:56.820
<i>like an unmelting blade of ice</i>

00:01:56.910 --> 00:02:00.370
<i>Kono mune wo sarashite</i>

00:01:56.910 --> 00:02:00.370
<i>you lay bare my heart</i>

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:05.250
<i>Dakishimeru</i>

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:05.250
<i>with your embrace</i>

00:02:19.140 --> 00:02:22.100
The one who sent you here was Xing Huo.

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:27.180
What did she say?

00:02:27.270 --> 00:02:31.020
"I must end the dream."

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:34.150
Yes, those children are
like fragments of dreams

00:02:34.230 --> 00:02:36.400
that cannot be realized, after all.

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:43.830
If you are here, it means you have a wish.

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:46.250
What is your wish?

00:02:46.330 --> 00:02:48.500
To go where my right eye is.

00:02:48.580 --> 00:02:51.790
I have already received
your compensation for that,

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:57.010
in relationship, freedom, and time.

00:02:57.090 --> 00:02:59.260
Your wish...

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:01.130
...shall be granted.

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:11.730
Sending you to your right eye

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:14.310
is within the sphere of
interference allowed to me.

00:03:14.400 --> 00:03:17.360
After all, I am only granting your wish.

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:19.440
But what comes next...

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:22.910
I have to get it back, no matter what.

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:24.950
Then, off you go.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:40.760
"I must end the dream."

00:03:40.840 --> 00:03:44.720
That was the last thing you said to me, huh?

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:45.760
Clow?

00:03:52.850 --> 00:03:55.310
Welcome home!

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:56.980
If you run around like that,
you're going to fall again.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.690
No problem!

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:02.030
Never mind me, Kamui
came back by himself earlier...

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:03.610
Mekyo!!

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:06.070
The feather is underground here, all right!

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:12.330
What do we do to get underground?

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.210
You can't.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:17.170
Only those who have
permission are allowed underground.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.090
The thing we're looking for is down there!

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:22.130
The only thing there
underground is water.

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:24.430
There's a feather, underneath us!

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:27.100
I'm begging you, please tell us how!

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:01.090
The girl is asleep.

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:03.840
If she were just asleep,
would she stop breathing?

00:05:03.930 --> 00:05:06.300
It's her soul that is asleep.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:25.450
What?

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:29.320
The barrier that was protecting
the Municipal Government Building...

00:05:29.410 --> 00:05:30.580
It's gone.

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:52.260
Just now, the power that had been underwater

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:55.060
has been taken inside here, and has disappeared.

00:05:55.140 --> 00:05:59.440
I thought you were sleeping here
because you'd been drawn in by that power,

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:01.690
so why don't you wake up?

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:08.700
Are you being drawn into this slumber?

00:06:17.080 --> 00:06:18.040
Syaoran!

00:06:21.420 --> 00:06:23.920
There's only one person allowed to go in.

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:25.920
As long as he doesn't take
any action toward the water,

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:29.510
Kamui will not kill him.

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:30.760
Syaoran...

00:06:34.270 --> 00:06:37.430
You're in my way. Move.

00:06:37.520 --> 00:06:39.980
We're underwater, yet I can hear his voice!

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:42.360
I'll say it again.

00:06:42.440 --> 00:06:43.610
Move.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:50.280
The water is so heavy, I can't move freely!

00:06:50.360 --> 00:06:53.160
What's more, I'm running out of breath!

00:07:00.580 --> 00:07:03.290
You're game, aren't you?

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:05.550
He said the same thing when we first met.

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:08.760
What is "game"?

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:11.300
You don't know?

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:13.220
He's reading my thoughts!

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:15.850
"Game" is fodder.

00:07:15.930 --> 00:07:17.100
Fodder?

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:27.110
That technique of yours...

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:46.550
If Subaru drinks all of your
blood, he might wake up...

00:07:49.970 --> 00:07:51.720
Blood?

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:53.180
Subaru?

00:07:57.270 --> 00:08:01.980
The twin vampires...

00:08:02.060 --> 00:08:04.810
So you know that man after all.

00:08:04.900 --> 00:08:08.320
You have the same techniques that he has.

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:14.160
I don't sense him in Tokyo, but
someone who knows him is now here.

00:08:14.240 --> 00:08:16.580
He may be coming soon.

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:19.540
Subaru, wake up.

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:24.120
The way things are going, he will catch up to us.

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:27.130
I swear I will kill him.

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:29.170
But before him, you.

00:08:36.140 --> 00:08:38.180
Syaoran...

00:08:38.260 --> 00:08:40.430
Syaoran-kun won't make it...

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:56.870
Subaru...

00:09:20.470 --> 00:09:25.350
Hands off. You won't get her feather.
I will get them all back.

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:26.810
No matter what.

00:09:27.810 --> 00:09:31.190
You're... different.

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:37.950
You can't!

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:39.370
Fai!

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:03.060
Wake up, Princess!

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:06.730
The one dear to you will
no longer be able to return!

00:10:06.810 --> 00:10:08.980
The one dear to me...

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:22.120
To think that game would be
able to possess this much power...

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:25.370
Game is that which is raised as
food by those who live on blood.

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:28.040
An imitation, a human form without a soul.

00:10:34.960 --> 00:10:38.300
Are you his master?

00:10:38.380 --> 00:10:39.720
No.

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.890
He wouldn't be from that hunter, would he?

00:10:42.970 --> 00:10:46.180
This is because Subaru gave him his blood.

00:10:46.270 --> 00:10:50.350
You're wrong. He really is a fine boy.

00:10:50.440 --> 00:10:52.520
He protects Sakura-chan,

00:10:52.610 --> 00:10:55.400
and works as hard as he
can to find her feathers.

00:11:00.910 --> 00:11:03.450
The seal on his right eye...

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:06.040
It has been broken.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:12.000
That is a copy, based on the
captive Clow Reed's descendant, Syaoran,

00:11:12.080 --> 00:11:14.460
meant to collect the feathers.

00:11:24.600 --> 00:11:29.980
The way I created him, he would give
up anything and remove any obstacle

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:34.520
to return the feathers to
the princess of Clow Country.

00:11:34.610 --> 00:11:35.980
However...

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:48.540
The original Syaoran
transferred his own soul into the copy,

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:51.290
within that eye.

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:54.500
I bound the original Syaoran
again with magic when he resisted,

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:57.750
and was about to remove
the right eye from the copy...

00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:07.140
But that's the offspring of Clow for you.

00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:11.810
If the right eye with its magic is
taken, the copy is also destroyed.

00:12:11.890 --> 00:12:14.730
One cannot make copies of
the original with equal strength

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:16.770
over and over again.

00:12:16.860 --> 00:12:20.690
Moreover, even with the soul
of another dwelling within him,

00:12:20.780 --> 00:12:23.990
so long as the goal of
collecting the feathers was met,

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:27.120
that was all I cared about.

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:29.790
And so, I let him go like that.

00:12:29.870 --> 00:12:31.960
I forecasted the time and the place,

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:34.370
such that the copy could go to Clow Country,

00:12:34.460 --> 00:12:38.960
and walk the path that would
lead him without any error

00:12:39.050 --> 00:12:43.260
to meet the princess,
the key to the power of the ruins.

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:46.890
Everything went according to
the course that had been set,

00:12:46.970 --> 00:12:49.140
until the witch interfered.

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:56.650
By giving up his left eye,
Syaoran's magic was divided in half.

00:12:56.730 --> 00:12:59.190
Thus, as time went by, and he grew,

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:01.150
he waited until he could break the seal

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:04.860
that Fei Wang had administered to incarcerate him.

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:08.990
His time and freedom offered as compensation.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.410
Fei Wang's magic is strong.

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:14.500
He, like Syaoran, is one of
Clow Reed's descendants,

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:17.380
and possesses enough power to succeed him.

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:19.880
Moreover, Fei Wang is certain to do anything he can

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:23.170
to make his dream come true.

00:13:23.260 --> 00:13:28.970
However, disrupting that is beyond
the sphere of allowable interference.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:31.100
The same is true of me
taking action against the Syaoran

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:37.060
who is with Fei Wang.
As such, I, too, have been waiting...

00:13:37.150 --> 00:13:40.150
...for Syaoran to awaken.

00:13:40.230 --> 00:13:43.360
But at the same time, it
also means that the seal over

00:13:43.440 --> 00:13:47.240
the second Syaoran's right eye has been broken.

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:49.870
The soul that had been
given to the second Syaoran

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:52.200
would return to the first Syaoran.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:54.080
Will Syaoran get there in time?

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:06.670
You are the one who sent Syaoran to the witch, right?

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:10.260
Xing Huo, now that I think
about where you came from,

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:13.600
perhaps that could not be avoided.

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:18.900
What's more, you are a defective product.

00:14:18.980 --> 00:14:21.360
I guess you can't hear me anymore.

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:27.780
You knew he was not human, right?

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:34.370
You possess considerable magic,
though you keep it contained.

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:37.250
And that thing you guys call a "soul"...

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:41.130
You knew that his was
given to him by another, right?

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:50.970
The magic in his right eye is about to run out.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:16.370
Someone is coming here, from another world.

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:19.370
It's not the hunter.

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:21.830
Another Syaoran-kun is coming.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:27.630
The magic in his right eye is disappearing.

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:29.720
That soul is yours.

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:31.090
It is something precious,

00:15:31.180 --> 00:15:36.060
created by you and Sakura-chan,
and the others who love you.

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:38.730
As such, you must not lose it.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:57.290
The same presence I felt from
that thing up until a moment ago

00:15:57.370 --> 00:15:58.750
is coming this way.

00:16:30.860 --> 00:16:32.450
Syaoran-kun...

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:47.250
Is that the only feather in this world?

00:16:47.340 --> 00:16:49.920
You use magic, don't you?

00:16:50.010 --> 00:16:53.220
Are your eyes the source of your magic?

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:57.890
I will need them to get the feathers back.

00:17:00.520 --> 00:17:02.180
The barrier protecting the Metropolitan
Government Building has disappeared.

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:07.150
Something appears to have
happened in the underground water tank.

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:10.190
You cannot go inside carrying
a weapon without permission.

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:22.830
What the...?

00:17:22.910 --> 00:17:27.290
She probably moved down to
where her soul is, under the water.

00:17:31.460 --> 00:17:32.550
Kurogane!

00:17:32.630 --> 00:17:34.970
Syaoran and Fai aren't
coming back out of the water!

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:36.430
What?

00:18:05.250 --> 00:18:07.830
Your eye...!

00:18:07.920 --> 00:18:14.880
Have you...

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:18.510
Stop!

00:18:18.590 --> 00:18:23.180
Did you eat... his eye?

00:18:30.230 --> 00:18:33.070
I'm taking his right eye, too.

00:18:33.150 --> 00:18:35.530
Hand him over to me.

00:18:35.610 --> 00:18:38.610
The source of his magic lies
in both of his blue eyes.

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:40.780
Once I take them both,
I will be done with him.

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:43.990
Give him to me!

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:45.450
Stop!

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:57.380
His arm is even broken...

00:18:57.470 --> 00:19:00.680
It looks like he doesn't feel physical pain.

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:02.600
Nor emotional pain.

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:06.770
Syaoran... Kurogane... Fai...!

00:19:06.850 --> 00:19:10.020
You're not the kid, are you?

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:14.570
Your presence feels different.
And yet, you're not someone else.

00:19:14.650 --> 00:19:18.030
I will get the feathers back, no matter what.

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:26.200
It feels like Fai! Is that Fai's magic?

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:33.920
You've devoured his magic, too?

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:37.670
I will obtain what I require
to get the feathers back.

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:39.340
I will eliminate anything in my way.

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:43.430
He changed for you and the princess' sake...

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:46.060
so that you and the princess could smile a little!

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:50.690
Don't you hear me, kid?!

00:20:02.700 --> 00:20:04.660
The ones dear to me...

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:13.670
The one most dear to me...

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:31.390
Guys!

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:40.690
Syaoran-kun...

00:20:50.000 --> 00:20:55.630
Half of my soul. I gave this to you, long ago.

00:20:55.710 --> 00:21:01.260
Once the seal was broken, the
magician tried to return it to you,

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:05.180
together with the left eye that was taken.

00:21:05.260 --> 00:21:08.510
However, once the seal was
broken, there was no going back,

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:11.350
regardless of the methods used.

00:21:11.430 --> 00:21:20.360
The magician must have known that.
Even so, he took a chance on the possibility.

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:22.610
It would seem he was not in time.

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:28.030
Syaoran-kun! Kurogane-san!

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:30.830
Fai-san! Moko-chan!

00:21:30.910 --> 00:21:34.830
I've been watching all this time,
through your right eye.

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:37.920
The events, and the people you encountered.

00:21:38.000 --> 00:21:41.880
I wasn't the one whose soul found
that princess to be most dear!

00:21:41.960 --> 00:21:43.760
It was you!

00:22:05.950 --> 00:22:08.610
A katana! The kid's is fine!

00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:10.320
Get it out and give it to me!

00:22:10.410 --> 00:22:11.780
R-Right!

00:22:35.270 --> 00:22:36.640
Syaoran-kun!

00:22:41.940 --> 00:22:44.650
Sakura! Kurogane!

00:22:44.740 --> 00:22:50.320
Fai! Syaoran!

00:22:50.410 --> 00:22:52.780
Syaoran-kun! Syaoran-kun!

00:23:02.210 --> 00:23:08.010
When I gave you half of my soul,
I told your image in the mirror...

00:23:08.090 --> 00:23:13.100
that I was betting by the time the
seal was broken and my soul left you,

00:23:13.180 --> 00:23:17.930
your own soul would be born.

00:23:18.020 --> 00:23:20.730
That I'd believe that as a result
of the days you would spend,

00:23:20.810 --> 00:23:25.690
and the people around you,
your own soul would develop!

00:23:25.780 --> 00:23:29.240
But that if enough time passed
for the seal on your right eye

00:23:29.320 --> 00:23:33.910
to be broken, and you still
didn't have your own soul--

00:23:33.990 --> 00:23:36.490
that if you would do as your
creator compelled you to do,

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:39.210
and continue to run out of control...

00:23:39.290 --> 00:23:42.540
that I would eliminate you!

00:23:42.630 --> 00:23:44.790
Raitei shorai!!

00:23:55.260 --> 00:23:58.680
Stop!

00:23:58.770 --> 00:24:01.730
Don't kill Syaoran-kun!

00:24:29.340 --> 00:24:30.710
Syaoran-kun...

00:25:03.830 --> 00:25:05.790
Wait, Kamui!

00:25:05.880 --> 00:25:07.710
Subaru!

00:25:07.790 --> 00:25:11.550
Wait.

00:25:11.630 --> 00:25:13.010
No!

00:25:32.280 --> 00:25:34.070
No, wait...!

00:25:44.660 --> 00:25:47.460
Syaoran-kun...

00:25:47.540 --> 00:25:50.130
I will get your feathers back.

00:25:50.210 --> 00:25:52.250
No matter what.

00:25:52.340 --> 00:25:54.630
There are no more feathers in this world.

00:25:54.720 --> 00:25:59.010
Thus, there is no need to remain in this world.

00:25:59.100 --> 00:26:02.060
I will look for your feathers in the next world.

00:26:18.910 --> 00:26:20.490
Don't leave.

00:26:31.800 --> 00:26:33.590
Syao--

00:26:53.320 --> 00:26:54.860
I'm sorry.

00:26:54.940 --> 00:26:59.490
You were awakened when it
was most painful for you, huh?

00:26:59.570 --> 00:27:02.950
Subaru!

00:27:03.030 --> 00:27:06.000
Thank goodness you're awake!

00:27:06.080 --> 00:27:08.370
I'm sorry for worrying you.

00:27:08.460 --> 00:27:10.460
Let's hurry on to the next world.

00:27:10.540 --> 00:27:12.750
Hold on.

00:27:12.840 --> 00:27:15.800
We have to go, before he catches up to us!

00:27:15.880 --> 00:27:17.670
Please, wait.

00:27:22.300 --> 00:27:25.430
What is that emblem on your chest?

00:27:25.520 --> 00:27:29.480
It is the crest of the ones who killed your mother.

00:27:55.630 --> 00:28:01.720
<i>Sagashite bakari no bokutachi wa</i>

00:27:55.630 --> 00:28:01.720
<i>All we do is search;</i>

00:28:01.800 --> 00:28:07.930
<i>kagami no you ni yoku niteru kara</i>

00:28:01.800 --> 00:28:07.930
<i>we're so similar, it's like looking in a mirror</i>

00:28:08.020 --> 00:28:14.270
<i>mukiau dake de tsunagaru no ni</i>

00:28:08.020 --> 00:28:14.270
<i>We just need to face each other to connect,</i>

00:28:14.360 --> 00:28:19.610
<i>fureau koto wa dekinai mama</i>

00:28:14.360 --> 00:28:19.610
<i>and yet we still cannot touch</i>

00:28:19.690 --> 00:28:25.780
<i>Me wo korashita</i>

00:28:19.690 --> 00:28:25.780
<i>I've looked hard</i>

00:28:25.870 --> 00:28:32.250
<i>Te wo nobashita</i>

00:28:25.870 --> 00:28:32.250
<i>I've reached out my hand</i>

00:28:32.330 --> 00:28:37.960
<i>Nee boku wa, boku wa shiritai</i>

00:28:32.330 --> 00:28:37.960
<i>Tell me, I want to know, I want to know,</i>

00:28:38.050 --> 00:28:43.800
<i>aisuru tte donna koto?</i>

00:28:38.050 --> 00:28:43.800
<i>what is it like to love?</i>

00:28:43.890 --> 00:28:56.270
<i>Kimi ga hohoemu to sekai
wa sukoshi furuete kagayaita</i>

00:28:43.890 --> 00:28:56.270
<i>When you smiled, the world
shook a little and gleamed</i>

00:28:56.360 --> 00:29:07.950
<i>Marude kokyuu suru
you ni ugokidashita</i>

00:28:56.360 --> 00:29:07.950
<i>It started to move, almost
as though it were breathing</i>

00:29:09.620 --> 00:29:15.420
<i>Nee boku wa, boku wa shiritai</i>

00:29:09.620 --> 00:29:15.420
<i>Tell me, I want to know, I want to know,</i>

00:29:15.500 --> 00:29:21.210
<i>Ikiteku tte donna koto?</i>

00:29:15.500 --> 00:29:21.210
<i>what is it like to live?</i>

00:29:21.300 --> 00:29:33.680
<i>Boku ga tazuneru to sekai
wa sukoshi furuete kagayaita</i>

00:29:21.300 --> 00:29:33.680
<i>When I asked you, the world
shook a little and gleamed</i>

00:29:33.770 --> 00:29:52.740
<i>The truth that rests within
me is now quietly set free</i>

00:29:33.770 --> 00:29:52.740
<i>Boku ni nemuru shinjitsu wo
ima shizuka ni tokihanatsu</i>
